    {
      "id": "ThNDP9C3O3iBOudgJWR2t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5500.555235930754,
      "y": 3880.26425274352,
      "width": 805.6166538900814,
      "height": 41.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "iQknJINLbpIDRIuZG9UIM",
        "Xzgm1kR5MC8ziw4S7WOKI",
        "jPIQ6GhCUy3rAP5LJKicB",
        "s5byTBW6_dZyFPP5kfKHS"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2019295674,
      "version": 5531,
      "versionNonce": 911901148,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790705154925,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mimi Audio Codec",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Mimi Audio Codec",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "created": 1790444120208,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "O8hF-kVjMcNptZq_elE-8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5455.4239029397095,
      "y": 3966.472408021302,
      "width": 890.8257853190103,
      "height": 1600,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "OcGZJcvlK2U6PiE9V7qAI",
        "jPIQ6GhCUy3rAP5LJKicB",
        "s5byTBW6_dZyFPP5kfKHS"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1470610042,
      "version": 6508,
      "versionNonce": 1407982052,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790705154925,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AudioLM is not a good fit for real time TTS. The main obstacle is its hierarchical\ngeneration schedule.\n\n                            \n                                                                    Stage 1\n                                                                    Generate semantic tokens\n                                                                    for the whole sequence\n\n                                                                            ↓\n\n                                                                    Stage 2\n                                                                    Generate coarse acoustic tokens\n                                                                    conditioned on semantic tokens\n\n                                                                            ↓\n\n                                                                    Stage 3\n                                                                    Generate fine acoustic tokens\n                                                                    conditioned on coarse tokens\n\n                                                                            ↓\n\n                                                                    SoundStream decoder\n\n                                                                            ↓\n\n                                                                    Audio\n\n\nSemantic tokens are not causal and can thus only be computed in an offline manner. \n\nTo achieve this Mimi uses distilation to transfer non-causal, high-level semantic\ninformation into the tokens produced by a causal model, allowing for streaming encoding\nand decoding of semantic-acoustic tokens.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe baseline architecture consists of an autoencoder and a Residual Vector Quantizer.\n\nThe encoder projects a single-channel waveform to a latent representation enc(x) using\nconvolutional blocks and add Transformer modules in the bottleneck to improve the ability\nof Mimi to encode speech into compact representations. Mimi’s encoder projects a 24kHz\nwaveform to a latent representation of 12.5 frames per second and dimension D = 512.\n\nThey discretize the latent space with a Residual Vector Quantizer , which\niteratively applies vector quantization (VQ) to the residuals of the previous quantizer.\nMimi converts audio into the discrete tokens predicted by Moshi and back, using residual\nvector  quantization (RVQ).\n\nDuring training they we distill semantic information from a self-supervised model (WavLM)\ninto the first level of the RVQ by computing a cosine distance between the output of the\nfirst quantizer and the transformed WavLM embeddings.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AudioLM is not a good fit for real time TTS. The main obstacle is its hierarchical generation schedule.\n\n                            \n                                                                    Stage 1\n                                                                    Generate semantic tokens\n                                                                    for the whole sequence\n\n                                                                            ↓\n\n                                                                    Stage 2\n                                                                    Generate coarse acoustic tokens\n                                                                    conditioned on semantic tokens\n\n                                                                            ↓\n\n                                                                    Stage 3\n                                                                    Generate fine acoustic tokens\n                                                                    conditioned on coarse tokens\n\n                                                                            ↓\n\n                                                                    SoundStream decoder\n\n                                                                            ↓\n\n                                                                    Audio\n\n\nSemantic tokens are not causal and can thus only be computed in an offline manner. \n\nTo achieve this Mimi uses distilation to transfer non-causal, high-level semantic information into the tokens produced by a causal model, allowing for streaming encoding and decoding of semantic-acoustic tokens.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe baseline architecture consists of an autoencoder and a Residual Vector Quantizer.\n\nThe encoder projects a single-channel waveform to a latent representation enc(x) using  convolutional blocks and add Transformer modules in the bottleneck to improve the ability of Mimi to encode speech into compact representations. Mimi’s encoder projects a 24kHz waveform to a latent representation of 12.5 frames per second and dimension D = 512.\n\nThey discretize the latent space with a Residual Vector Quantizer , which\niteratively applies vector quantization (VQ) to the residuals of the previous quantizer.\nMimi converts audio into the discrete tokens predicted by Moshi and back, using residual vector  quantization (RVQ).\n\nDuring training they we distill semantic information from a self-supervised model (WavLM) into the first level of the RVQ by computing a cosine distance between the output of the first quantizer and the transformed WavLM embeddings.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1790444120208,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "T2zmIzpfo42H_YS64JraH",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 6483.634145102219,
      "y": 4916.614131000584,
      "width": 545,
      "height": 471,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "transparent",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "HB3lPkbGRL3MkwOy3VvgU",
        "jPIQ6GhCUy3rAP5LJKicB",
        "s5byTBW6_dZyFPP5kfKHS"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2i",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1853774650,
      "version": 404,
      "versionNonce": 1139140188,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
