      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Codebooks are not equally important\nα = 100 for the semantic codebook and\nα = 1 for the acoustic codebooks.\n",
